            "notes": "## Power\n\nIn Round 1, you can pick either [Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb) or [Cross-Orbal](item_e567bb63-527f-4c72-8ba1-dc59be1a0dc1). I personally usually go for [Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb), as it allows me to put out more damage orbs, which means more debuffs. The way you want to use [Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb) is by walking directly into a chokepoint and then fade back to your team behind cover. This can leave you vulnerable, so do be careful! If this doesn't sound like something you're really comfortable with, go for [Cross-Orbal](item_e567bb63-527f-4c72-8ba1-dc59be1a0dc1) instead, which is always a safer choice. Using [Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb), you will also have to make sure that your last selected orb is a damage orb, though putting out a healing orb every once in a while before we actually have our debuff items can't hurt.\n\nIf you want to go straight into debuff orbs in Round 2, you can also go for [Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560), but I don't generally recommend it, as the 85% reduced effectiveness makes it pretty much useless in the early rounds. Another option is [Chain Grasp](item_17b85f3e-1b10-410d-8e02-c7ff61f502a0) and while it doesn't directly help with debuffing, it does give you a lot of Stadium Cash in the early rounds. [Chain Grasp](item_17b85f3e-1b10-410d-8e02-c7ff61f502a0) also works on deployables, such as [Sigma](hero_646d9571-c40a-4403-b6c1-fb67adb6112d)'s barrier, [Winston](hero_a0ebe5ef-69a6-4a8f-9360-7b7fed8bce88)'s barrier and [Junkrat](hero_3ac20f6c-2bce-45f3-998e-9129cc6e5c05)'s trap. It doesn't work on [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49)'s or [Brigitte](hero_8d4e7c27-fb70-4694-9721-2ecf094ef84a)'s barriers however, so I don't recommend using it when playing against [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) especially.\n\n## Items\n\nAs for items, I usually go for [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) for survivability, [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) for some [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) for both. We're building entirely around our orbs, so [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) is pretty much essential, but the other items are entirely up to your own preferences. Especially for Round 1, you don't have to focus just on [Ability Power](stat_ability_power). [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7), [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) or [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) can also be good options. Go for these last two if you picked [Chain Grasp](item_17b85f3e-1b10-410d-8e02-c7ff61f502a0) as your power.",
