            "notes": "## Power\n\nIn Round 3, you get to pick another power and I usually go for [Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560). By Round 3, you should have at least one of [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) or [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98). [Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560) does very little damage, but it'll help with applying these debuffs to as many players as possible. You can also go for [Cross-Orbal](item_e567bb63-527f-4c72-8ba1-dc59be1a0dc1) or [Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb), depending on which power you picked in Round 1.\n\n## Items\n\nTo further help with applying your debuffs, [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be) is a must-have. Depending on your Stadium Cash, get either one or both of [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) and [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98). Fill the rest of your slots with cheaper items that give [Ability Power](stat_ability_power).",
