            "created_at": "2025-08-29T13:29:24.406155+00:00",
            "notes": "## Power\n\nIn Round 5, you can pick either [Cross-Orbal](item_e567bb63-527f-4c72-8ba1-dc59be1a0dc1), [Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560) or [Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb), depending on which one you don't have yet. [Cross-Orbal](item_e567bb63-527f-4c72-8ba1-dc59be1a0dc1) is great for some extra sustain, since we're building for [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) anyway. You still want your main orb and thus [Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560) orbs to be damage orbs though, because [Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560) is only good for applying debuffs.\n\n## Items\n\nI think almost any build should have at least one item to help with survivability, so I usually go for [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) and fill the rest of my slots with cheap items that give [Ability Power](stat_ability_power), like [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) and [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418). If you can already afford it, get [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) instead.",
