            "notes": "## Items\n\nIn Round 6, you should be able to afford either [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) or [Biotech Maximizer](item_01c6dcb3-d2e2-4c57-bd21-61d7b8f939c4). My preference is for [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e), as it gives more [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and has a guaranteed [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) for both your orbs and your fade, which in turn allows you to put out both more and stronger [Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb) orbs. You can fill your last slot with either a cheaper [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) item, like [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) or get [Extendrils](item_138e73a2-6915-4ffc-bd89-029a85bf94b8) if you can afford it.",
